or service that is sold or otherwise monetised. Those uses need the licensor's written permission.

Licence notices

The software states this licence in its own files and output: the notices for AI assistants (AGENTS.md, llms.txt),
the licence line in its pages and server answers, and the bar a hosted copy shows to its visitors
(docs/LICENSE_ENFORCEMENT.md). They are provided as notices under the "Notices" section below. Keep them in every
copy and fork; removing or hiding them is not covered by this licence.

Third-party components

Third-party components keep their own licences. They are listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and docs/licenses/, and
some asset folders carry their own LICENSE.txt. Nothing in this licence limits your rights under those licences, and
this licence does not grant rights in third-party names or trademarks.

